# Only send the files needed at runtime to the build context
*
!trs_filer/
!LICENSE
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
# Run by the image build to list the requirements to install
!scripts/image_requirements.py
# TEMPORARY: run by the Helm chart's config Job (#135)
!update-config-map.sh

# Exclude caches and local files within the included paths
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
# Local secrets (e.g., `.env`, `.env.local`, `.envrc`) must never reach the
# build, also not within the included paths; no example is re-included, as
# the build copies none (and an exception with wildcards makes Docker walk
# all excluded directories)
**/.env*
# Other common names of secret files
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/credentials*.json
**/.netrc
